  "oral_argument": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2924a7156c2098f2cbecc5ccc380537b4eb993e4194a45c405e0577aaab0d6b0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2924a7156c20-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice asked: \u201cThese are all contingent rights.\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2924a7156c2098f2cbecc5ccc380537b4eb993e4194a45c405e0577aaab0d6b0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2924a7156c20-0001-0008"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice asked: \u201cCommunity property is not owned by a community which is a separate entity?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2924a7156c2098f2cbecc5ccc380537b4eb993e4194a45c405e0577aaab0d6b0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2924a7156c20-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 37,
              "start": 37
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice asked: \u201cIs that wrong?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2924a7156c2098f2cbecc5ccc380537b4eb993e4194a45c405e0577aaab0d6b0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2924a7156c20-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice asked: \u201cYes, that may be, but why \u2026 a lot of property \u2026 owned by communities \u2026 tenancy by the entirety.\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2924a7156c2098f2cbecc5ccc380537b4eb993e4194a45c405e0577aaab0d6b0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2924a7156c20-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice asked: \u201cHow many States are there that have tenancies by the entireties?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Sutton",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2924a7156c2098f2cbecc5ccc380537b4eb993e4194a45c405e0577aaab0d6b0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2924a7156c20-0002-0011"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Mr. Sutton responded that 14 states and the District of Columbia have traditional tenancies by the entirety."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2924a7156c2098f2cbecc5ccc380537b4eb993e4194a45c405e0577aaab0d6b0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2924a7156c20-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice asked: \u201cWell, didn\u2019t this Court comment on that in the Rodgers decision \u2026?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2924a7156c2098f2cbecc5ccc380537b4eb993e4194a45c405e0577aaab0d6b0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2924a7156c20-0002-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 41,
              "start": 41
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice asked: \u201cIn this particular case, wasn\u2019t the Sixth Circuit saying \u2026 we have to follow that old precedent?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2924a7156c2098f2cbecc5ccc380537b4eb993e4194a45c405e0577aaab0d6b0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2924a7156c20-0002-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 42,
              "start": 42
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice asked: \u201cIf you follow that rationale \u2026 a husband and wife could hold a closely held corporation by the entirety and wouldn\u2019t be liable for income tax?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2924a7156c2098f2cbecc5ccc380537b4eb993e4194a45c405e0577aaab0d6b0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2924a7156c20-0002-0008"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 48,
              "start": 48
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice asked: \u201cMr. Sutton, I think there was considerable attention in the Drye case to exactly what it is you look to State law for.\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2924a7156c2098f2cbecc5ccc380537b4eb993e4194a45c405e0577aaab0d6b0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2924a7156c20-0002-0010"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 53,
              "start": 53
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice asked: \u201cMr. Sutton, this is a question of what the Federal taxing authority can do.\u201d"
      }
    ],
