        "text": "The United States is the petitioner and Sandra L. Craft is the respondent."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Jones",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2924a7156c2098f2cbecc5ccc380537b4eb993e4194a45c405e0577aaab0d6b0",
            "evidence_ids": [
